From: morikon <leafpmpmp@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 13 Oct 2026 14:00:00 +0800
Subject: media: sophgo: add the CV1800/SG2000 MIPI CSI-2 receiver

Add a driver for the MIPI CSI-2 receiver MAC 0 and its D-PHY. The lane
order comes from the device tree. The driver derives the D-PHY HS
settle time from the link frequency of the sensor.
